hardyaka-payoneer:greenhouse:7882561.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Payoneer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2005, Payoneer is the global financial platform that removes friction from doing business across borders, with a mission to connect the world’s underserved businesses to a rising global economy. We’re a community with over 2,500 colleagues all over the world, working to serve customers, and partners in over 190 countries and territories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By taking the complexity out of the financial workflows–including everything from global payments and compliance to multi-currency and workforce management, to providing working capital and business intelligence–we give businesses the tools they need to work efficiently worldwide and grow with confidence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Sao Paulo, Brazil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-time&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Payoneer is looking for an energetic and ambitious&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Partnerships Manager&lt;/strong&gt; in Latin America – based in Sao Paulo – who takes ownership to the highest level, can learn quickly in a fast-paced environment and to grow new and existing partner accounts through effective executive engagement. You will drive new partners, manage an existing portfolio, and handle the end-to-end partner management in collaboration with other team members. Working in a dynamic business environment, you will be responsible for identifying and collaborating with the potential partners to drive acquisition and expansion of Payoneer reach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to being adept at both business development and account management, the ideal candidate should possess strong analytical skills to create programs and processes to enable the channel partnerships function to grow at scale. This role is will report to the regional head of partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Build and grow a strong network of partners and affiliates to utilize Payoneer’s platform and products; commercial cards, sending and receiving of payments&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Uncover new verticals.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Build partnerships and relationships that drives acquisition of clients across numerous verticals, eg, Knowledge Based Services, Remote Working, Ecommerce, Fintech, and Advertising&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Contribute strategic depth in driving business analysis and market development activities in the region&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Represent Payoneer at partner events and industry shows&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Bachelor’s degree, preferably in business administration or engineering&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;5+ years of experience in business development or partnerships&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Fluent in English and Spanish&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Experience in data analysis, deal making, partnerships, managing relationships and creating new opportunities.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Strategic thinking and independent thought coupled with ability to drive business end-to-end and execute&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Strong written and oral communication skills&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Excellent quantitative skills to quickly and accurately analyze complex information / data to draw conclusions and insights in clear written and oral communications&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Flexibility to travel&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Not a must but a great advantage:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Experience in Fintech, payments, foreign exchange&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Knowledge of growth hacking tactics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;269&quot; data-end=&quot;280&quot;&gt;#LI-AB4&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Payoneer Ways of Working&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Act as our customer’s partner on the inside&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Learning what they need and creating what will help them go further.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Do it. Own it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Being fearlessly accountable in everything we do.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Continuously improve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Always striving for a higher standard than our last.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
