;TextRun SCXW125721225 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW125721225 BCX0&quot;&gt;We are currently recruiting for a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW125721225 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackedChange SCXW125721225 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW125721225 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW125721225 BCX0&quot;&gt;Home Health Aide&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW125721225 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackedChange SCXW125721225 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW125721225 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW125721225 BCX0&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackedChange SCXW125721225 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW125721225 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW125721225 BCX0&quot;&gt;HHA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW125721225 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackedChange SCXW125721225 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW125721225 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW125721225 BCX0&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW125721225 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW125721225 BCX0&quot;&gt; to reliably serve patients in the following counties [county one, county two, county three] in BAYADA’s &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackedChange SCXW125721225 BCX