&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;4&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We celebrate&amp;nbsp;strong performance&amp;nbsp;with financial rewards, peer-to-peer recognition, and growth opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

remotely-hellofresh:greenhouse:7967829.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced and strategic leader to join our Procurement Leadership team as Director, Strategic Sourcing, Packaging for North America. This is a high-impact role at a pivotal moment for our business — we are integrating two distinct packaging organizations (CA and US) into a unified NA function, expanding our product portfolio significantly, and building the supply chain infrastructure to support the next phase of HelloFresh’s growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the VP Strategic Sourcing, you will own the end-to-end packaging sourcing strategy across North America, leading a team of Strategy Managers accountable for key categories including Corrugated, Liners, Media, Ice, and Ready-to-Eat packaging (trays, lidding film, and other formats). You will partner closely with other Sourcing leaders to build a high-performing, strategically aligned organization and serve as a key member of the Procurement Leadership team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead &amp;amp; Build the NA Packaging Sourcing Organization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a key member of the Procurement Leadership team, partnering with the VP of Procurement to shape the strategic direction of packaging sourcing across North America&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and develop a team of Strategy Managers across core packaging categories (Corrugated, Liners, Media, Ice, RTE packaging), fostering a high-performance culture grounded in HelloFresh’s DNA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the integration of the CA and US packaging sourcing teams — aligning ways of working, processes, and tools while respecting the distinct needs of each market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a team culture of urgency, ownership, and continuous improvement; challenge the organization to deliver outsized results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Packaging Sourcing Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute short and long-term NA packaging sourcing roadmap that supports HelloFresh’s growth strategy across brands and product formats — from traditional meal kits to RTE meals, smoothies, and beyond&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and oversee the achievement of OKRs on cost, supply chain resilience, innovation, supplier performance, and team development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and pursue opportunities to platform sourcing globally, leveraging HelloFresh’s international scale where beneficial&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore and develop innovative supply chain models including insourcing of packaging inputs (e.g. recipe card printing, liner production) where commercially justified&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Cost, Quality &amp;amp; Supply Chain Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support annual budgeting and drive savings initiatives across NA packaging spend; communicate monthly category performance to Senior Leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead multi-million dollar contract negotiations and RFP processes across key packaging categories, applying a total cost of ownership (TCO) lens to all commercial decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale and strengthen our supplier network to support menu expansion and customization; manage supply chain risk through dual-sourcing strategies, supplier performance management, and proactive contingency planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Packaging Engineering to ensure suppliers meet quality and specification requirements, and identify opportunities to improve packaging performance, sustainability, and margin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve inventory management and supply planning approaches across the NA network, reducing exposure and increasing agility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional Partnership &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Operations, Finance, and Engineering to ensure packaging sourcing strategies support business needs across a growing and diversifying product range&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate competing priorities across NA business units and brands, providing clear recommendations and influencing stakeholders at the most senior levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent NA Packaging Sourcing in global forums, identifying and pursuing cross-border sourcing opportunities where scale and economics support it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strategic packaging sourcing leader with a track record of building high-performing teams and delivering measurable commercial results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity and change — you challenge the status quo, ask hard questions, and drive clarity in complex, evolving environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An expert negotiator with hands-on experience managing multi-million dollar contracts and complex supplier relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A data-driven decision maker who builds the analytical rigor and commercial discipline of the teams you lead&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong people leader with proven experience developing diverse, geographically distributed teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A skilled communicator who can translate complex supply chain trade-offs into clear recommendations for senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile and self-directed — you thrive in fast-paced environments, move quickly, and bring others along with you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious and externally connected — you stay close to market trends, supplier innovation, and global sourcing opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of progressive experience in procurement or strategic sourcing, with significant packaging category experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience building and leading high-performing sourcing teams, ideally across multiple geographies or business units&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience in RFPs, contract negotiations, category strategy development, and supplier performance management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial acumen including budget management, TCO modeling, and cost driver analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating organizational change, integration, or transformation — ideally in a fast-growing, multi-brand environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree in Supply Chain Management, Business Administration, or a related field is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to travel (up to 25%)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Google Suite; comfort with data tools and supply chain systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, 401k with company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO, including sabbatical, and parental leave of up to 16 weeks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Tuition reimbursement for continuing education (upon 2 years of service)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;New York Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$158,550&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$200,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

remotely-hellofresh:greenhouse:8000664.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;As the Youfoodz Brand Marketing Associate, you’ll play a key role in shaping how the brand shows up across channels. You’ll support the Brand Lead in developing and rolling out brand campaigns, tell product stories in a way that feels simple and real, and help translate our platform into assets that work hard in the channels for which they’re created.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work across everything from brand storytelling and campaign messaging to content operations and AI assisted creative production. One day you might be writing email copy or meal descriptions, the next you’ll be helping turn a big brand idea into a suite of social assets, or partnering with Growth and our Influencer &amp;amp; Creator Marketing Manager to make creative feel cohesive.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re a strong writer with a feel for storytelling, but you also love the nuts and bolts of content. You can turn briefs and customer &amp;amp; performance insights into assets that actually work. You’re curious about AI and new tools, have a firm finger on the cultural and trend pulse and enjoy operating in the grey space between brand building and performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our Chippendale Head Office and reports to Brand Lead - Youfoodz.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop compelling, on-brand copy for brand marketing activities, from product positioning and communication plans to emails, paid advertising, landing pages, and flyers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the brand, growth, retail, design, and product teams to create engaging digital and printed content aligned with the Youfoodz brand strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write, proof, and edit copy and all branded collateral, across all channels, making suggestions that are in line with brand guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run AI-assisted creative workflows to generate and version mid-lower funnel creative across channels, and support creative testing programs by producing variations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the organisation of the copy request pipeline, ensuring the workflow is kept on track and copy is delivered on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive best practice programs by following the latest content, community, and social trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the organic social strategy and calendar, aligning content with brand campaigns, product stories, and cultural moments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Influencer &amp;amp; Creator Marketing Manager to ensure creator content and UGC are repurposed effectively into brand assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Retail Marketing Manager by providing brand-aligned strategy, copy, and creative direction into Youfoodz retail initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support PR and brand shoot logistics and production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 - 4 years of experience in a similar role with a focus on digital marketing, social, content development, and copywriting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of content marketing trends and SEO.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with social and digital channels and an understanding of what makes creative perform in-feed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working with or learning AI automation tools (e.g., generative copy/creative, templating platforms) to scale production and experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and written skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant tertiary qualifications in communications, media, or marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A foodie who loves home-cooking and has a desire to work in the food industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural storyteller who enjoys turning insights into simple, engaging ideas and assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, creative, and digitally native. You live on social, you watch what brands are doing, and you’re excited about where AI can help you work smarter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excited about communication, a strategic thinker, and full of new ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident, creative, and ‘switched on’.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, ambitious, and assertive: you think beyond the scope of your assignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and comfortable working with multiple stakeholders both locally and globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone who cares about the details, both in the work and how the brand shows up in the real world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to have a significant impact in a leading global food technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working arrangements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An egoless environment, with constant learning and room for personal growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free access to Headspace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal learning &amp;amp; development programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A diverse and vibrant international environment, with offices in 18 countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company discount – 70% off HelloFresh &amp;amp; 40% off Youfoodz.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start Date:&lt;/strong&gt; ASAP (we can wait for your notice period).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent full-time role. (You must have the right to work full-time in Australia).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Chippendale Head Office – hybrid working environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive salary &amp;amp; employee benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

remotely-keeper-security:greenhouse:4113.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Keeper Security is hiring a driven, English speaking Channel Account Manager to join our APAC Channel team. This role will have a heavy focus on growing Non Japan Asian including Singapore,&amp;nbsp; New Zealand and Australian partner relationships. Focus on Ingram Micro ANZ and Singapore Launch. Candidates must be able to work remotely in Sydney, New South Wales, Australia office for eligibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Keeper’s cybersecurity software is trusted by millions of people and thousands of organizations, globally. Keeper is published in 23 languages and is sold in over 150 countries. Join one of the fastest-growing cybersecurity companies and be responsible for building pipeline and channel revenue with high performance partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Keeper&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Keeper Security APAC 株式会社 (&quot;Keeper&quot;) is transforming cybersecurity for millions of individuals and thousands of organizations globally. Built with end-to-end encryption, Keeper&#39;s intuitive cybersecurity platform is trusted by Fortune 100 companies to protect every user, on every device, in every location. Our patented zero-trust and zero-knowledge privileged access management solution unifies enterprise password, secrets and connections management with zero-trust network access, endpoint privilege management and remote browser isolation. By combining these critical identity and access management components into a single cloud-based solution, Keeper delivers unparalleled visibility, security and control while ensuring compliance and audit requirements are met. Learn how Keeper can defend your organization against today’s cyber threats at &lt;a href=&quot;http://keepersecurity.com&quot;&gt;KeeperSecurity.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Channel Account Manager, Japan will report to our Director of Global Channel Account Management, carrying a primary focus on building pipeline and channel revenue with existing channel partners. There will also be a heavy focus sourcing strategic new channel relationships. This position requires the candidate to be extremely motivated, results-driven and have a good network within the channel ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for the day-to-day recruitment and relationship management of channel partners to include value added resellers, distributors, systems integrators and strategic software partners (primarily in New Zealand and Australia)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a liaison between Keeper and assigned channel partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, maintain, and manage relationships with current and prospective channel partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish productive, professional relationships with key sales and channel personnel in assigned partner accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate the involvement of Keeper personnel, including support, service, and management resources, in order to meet partner performance objectives and partners’ expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate in English and Japanese, both verbally and in writing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sell through partner organizations to end users in coordination with partner sales resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet assigned targets for profitable sales volume and strategic objectives in assigned partner accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage direct/channel conflict by fostering excellent communication between the channel and direct sales teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure partner compliance with Channel Partner programs and agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in a partner planning process that develops mutual performance objectives, financial targets, and critical milestones associated with a productive partner relationship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify partner GTM &amp;amp;/or services offerings; working with partner sales resources, marketing, etc. develop &amp;amp; launch offerings to point of incremental joint revenue achievement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with technology vendors to identify mutual greenfield opportunities with shared partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain channel opportunity registrations in Salesforce.com and assist the direct sales team in closing channel generated leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute on Channel Marketing activities and events to support brand awareness and demand generation with the Strategic Partner group&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel to and from customer meetings (locally and nationally) &amp;amp; rent and/or operate a vehicle on behalf of the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of channel sales experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must have English language proficiency for business purposes, with excellent verbal and written communication skills, Japanese professional language proficiency is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling into New Zealand and Australian markets with proven success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success driving revenue growth via channel partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of Partner Incentive programs and PRM tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills and ability to excel in a team oriented atmosphere&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extremely motivated and goal-oriented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must want a career-oriented environment that is both fun and professional&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You share our values, and work in accordance with those values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel up to 50%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Keeper is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Keeper Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;This notice explains how Keeper Security processes your personal data during recruitment. Depending on the role and location, the Controller of personal data (the organization responsible for determining why and how personal data is processed) will be Keeper Security Inc. (US), Keeper Security EMEA Ltd. (Ireland), or Keeper Security APAC K.K (Japan).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt; 1. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Data We Collect&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Information You provide:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Contact details, CV/resume, cover letter&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Employment history, qualifications, work eligibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Application responses and uploaded documents&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Information We generate:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Interview notes, assessments, communications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Scheduling information&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Information From Others:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Recruiter/referral information who submit your profile&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;References (with your consent, before final offer)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Public professional profiles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Background verification (post offer)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt; Voluntary Diversity and Equal Opportunity Information&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;We may ask you to voluntarily provide diversity information including race/ethnicity, gender, disability status and veteran status (US). Providing this information is optional and Keeper collects this data in order to comply with EEOC and similar requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt; 2. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;How We Use Your Data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Assess your application and suitability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Manage interviews and recruitment workflow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Consider you for other/future roles (we may seek your consent to keep your information on our systems beyond the retention period specified)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Comply with employment law obligations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt; 3. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Legal Basis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Legitimate Interests (recruitment management, security and integrity of the hiring process)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Contracting steps (for progressed candidates)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Legal and regulatory compliance obligations; explicit consent where required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt; 4. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Who We Share Information With&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Internal: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;HR, hiring managers, interviewers*, IT support for system administration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;*Note - diversity and equal opportunity data is not shared with hiring managers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Third Parties:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Service providers who assist with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Applicant tracking, recruitment systems and assessment providers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Background verification vendors (post offer)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Recruitment agencies (where applicable)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Tools to support communication, collaboration and to securely store your data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Keeper ensures that all our third parties are contractually bound to protect your personal data with adequate safeguards in place.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt; 5. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;International Transfers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Your data may be accessed by Keeper entities globally as needed for the purposes of hiring and decision making. We protect any such data transfer between Keeper entities using appropriate safeguards under applicable data protection laws. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;6. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your data, consistent with our industry leading security standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;7. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Retention&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;We keep your data for 24 months from your last application activity, then delete or anonymize it. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Exceptions:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;You opt into our talent database for further retention by providing consent (extended retention)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;You&#39;re hired (transfers to employee records)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt; 8. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Your Rights&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;You have the following rights and can contact us at the email below to exercise them:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Access, correct, or delete your data, subject to applicable law and retention requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Object to or restrict processing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Withdraw consent (where applicable)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Request data portability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;pf1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Lodge a complaint with your data protection authority&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;If you become an employee, your rights regarding your employee record are governed by our internal Employee Privacy Notice and certain data will be retained as required under relevant laws such as employment or tax law.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;When you request access to your personal data, some information may be redacted if it includes the personal data of other individuals or information that we must protect in order to preserve their privacy rights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt; 9. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Automated Decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;Keeper does not make hiring decisions using solely automated processing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;pf0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt;10. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Contact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf1&quot;&gt; - Candidates can send privacy questions to: privacy@keepersecurity.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

